{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act52side_level_act52side_01_beg","storyGroup":"act52side","storySort":2,"storyDependence":"act52side_level_act52side_st01","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"YW-1","storyName":"互助会","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"惩戒军德鲁莎对打捞中心的技术工产生了怀疑。另一边，新官上任的克莱门莎意识到岛民与伊比利亚人之间的矛盾不容小觑。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act52side/level_act52side_01_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act52side_01_beg","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":0,"next":2,"characters":["工头","阴沉的路人","洒脱的路人","萨尔瓦多","特菲","瓦列里奥","南多","德鲁莎","干练的技术工","纳乔","阿奎拉","清晰的女声","紧张的潜水员","克莱门莎","语言模块","警惕的岛民","？？？","欣慰的岛民"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_bg_74_g5_gdsquare_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_harbor_busy","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"0.6","id":6},{"type":"playsound","key":"$factory_low_drone","loop":"true","channel":"bgs1","volume":"0.5","id":7},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":8},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":9},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_comedy_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":10,"musicid":0},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_hammerhit","volume":"0.2","delay":"1","id":11},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2275_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":12},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":13},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工头","text":"听到锤子和锯床的声音了吗？各位，你们有多久没在伊比利亚见过造船厂了？","id":14,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_2275_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工头","text":"修船、制帆、测风向、画海图……哪怕你毫无经验，也可以从头学起。","id":15,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_2275_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"工头","text":"岛民们也无需担心，打捞中心和船厂平等地向所有人敞开大门，人人都有机会为两周后港都中心城区的打捞出力！","id":16,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_avg_npc_2275_1$1.png"},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs1","fadetime":"2","id":17},{"type":"dialog","id":18},{"type":"charslot","id":19},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":20},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2274_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":21},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":22},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"l","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阴沉的路人","text":"港都……黄金时代的都城……它在经典中被批判为罪孽滋生的源头之一。","id":24,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_npc_2274_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阴沉的路人","text":"岛民同样不可被信任，他们是引来大静谧的元凶的后代，他们是不祥之征……","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_npc_2274_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":26},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_461_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":27},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":28},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"r","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"洒脱的路人","text":"别再重复教士们的教诲了，萨尔瓦多，赶路的两个月来它可没为我们带来一顿饱饭——但船厂的工作可以。","id":30,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_461_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"l","id":31},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萨尔瓦多","text":"既然如此，为什么还有那么多人跟我们一样站在远处观望？","id":32,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_npc_2274_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"r","id":33},{"type":"dialogue","name":"洒脱的路人","text":"嗐，大家都是从偏僻的捕鳞村来的，哪里见过这样的阵仗？","id":34,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_461_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"洒脱的路人","text":"城区里岛民随处可见，惩戒军却很少盘问他们；人们打招呼的方式不是引用经文，而是直接问对方饭有没有吃饱。","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_461_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"洒脱的路人","text":"老实说我也不知道打捞港都到底对我们有什么意义，但如果这里的生活更好，我愿意暂时违背经典里的几条教诲。","id":36,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_461_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"l","id":37},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萨尔瓦多","text":"圣徒在上，他要是看到了这般混乱的景象会怎么想，到时候我们就需要在审判庭的地牢里忏悔了……","id":38,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_npc_2274_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"r","id":39},{"type":"dialogue","name":"洒脱的路人","text":"我不知道圣徒阁下会怎么想，但我知道至少在这里，审判庭不再像原来那样严苛了。","id":40,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_461_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"l","id":41},{"type":"dialogue","name":"萨尔瓦多","text":"……怎么证明？","id":42,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_npc_2274_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"r","id":43},{"type":"dialogue","name":"洒脱的路人","text":"喏，你看那边——连那个跟黄金时代的雕像勾肩搭背的小姑娘都没被押进地牢里，我们还怕什么？","id":44,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_avg_npc_461_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":45},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":46},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":47},{"type":"charslot","id":48},{"type":"background","id":49},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9e/Avg_74_i04.png","xScale":"1.4","yScale":"1.4","screenadapt":"coverall","y":"50","x":"100","id":50},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.1","fillto":"0.2","fadetime":"0.1","id":51},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.1","fillto":"0.2","fadetime":"0.1","id":52},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":53},{"type":"imagetween","xTo":"0","duration":"30","id":54},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":55},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":56},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"咳咳，在万众瞩目的启动仪式上，正是这首由我指挥、由我领唱的船歌，见证了国王的雕像被打捞上岸。","id":57},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"你们是否好奇，一个名不见经传的年轻人，怎么会唱伊比利亚百年前的船歌？怎么会穿着完全不合身的海军制服？","id":58},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"又怎么会有那么大的胆子，跟审判庭专设的招工处分庭抗礼，堂而皇之地在刚举办过启动仪式的广场上演讲？","id":59},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"哦，你们或许有人会说，自从圣徒卡门阁下向全伊比利亚宣布打捞港都的计划之后，审判庭信守的教义不同以往。","id":60},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"可怜的人，我看到你们中的好几个人露出了赞同或迷茫的表情……不过他们的宽容，显然不是我“胆大妄为”的原因。","id":61},{"type":"dialog","id":62},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":63},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.2","fillto":"0","fadetime":"0","id":64},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.2","fillto":"0","fadetime":"0","id":65},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9e/Avg_74_i04.png","xScale":"1.1","yScale":"1.1","screenadapt":"coverall","y":"-20","id":66},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":67},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"喏，看到我身边的这位先生了吗？有谁知道他的名讳？","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"这一位，曾经的伊比利亚王室海军上将，埃斯特班·恩里克斯·德·托莱多，与我关系匪浅……","id":69},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"啊，你们想必已经猜到了，毕竟我与他的着装和长相如此相像！","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"骨相、脸型、耳羽的位置，甚至发质……还有我身上的王室海军制服，都是他给我留下的证据！","id":71},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"两周之后，雷亚-伊比利亚即将归来，你们难道不会好奇，那座曾经属于王室的都城会回到谁的手里？","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"瓦列里奥","text":"小心一点，审判庭的人看过来了……","id":73},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"放心，德·托莱多家族赞赏审判庭为伊比利亚付出的一切。我只是想拿回埋葬在港都中心城区中的，属于家族的遗产和宝藏。","id":74},{"type":"dialog","id":75},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":76},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleTo":"1.5","yScaleTo":"1.5","yTo":"-150","duration":"0.3","id":77},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_lensSpeedLines_soft","layer":"1","id":78},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"追随我，埃斯特菲尼娅·科隆·德·托莱多，伊比利亚王室海军的继承者。只要一点小小的资助……","id":79},{"type":"dialogue","name":"特菲","text":"啊不对——只要你们拥护我，我也将庇佑你们，无谓出身！","id":80},{"type":"dialog","id":81},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":82},{"type":"charslot","id":83},{"type":"bgeffect","id":84},{"type":"image","id":85},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":86},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_bg_74_g5_gdsquare_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":87},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":88},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":89},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":90},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2269_1#8$1","duration":"0.5","id":91},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":92},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2269_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":93},{"type":"dialogue","name":"南多","text":"前天盘查的时候她还说自己是乐队的小号手，怎么又成伊比利亚王室海军的继承者了？这么明显的谎话竟然还有人在认真听？","id":94,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_npc_2269_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":95},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"（打哈欠）不准动手。","id":96,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_2267_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2269_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":97},{"type":"dialogue","name":"南多","text":"我知道现在审判庭的行动方针很谨慎，但您真的不觉得这个“德·托莱多”很可疑吗？","id":98,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_npc_2269_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"南多","text":"如果我的观察没错，她的身份一定有问题，甚至可能根本没有获得居住资格。","id":99,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_npc_2269_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2269_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":100},{"type":"dialogue","name":"南多","text":"她费尽心机混进来，万一是要对打捞工程不利……德鲁莎教官，我申请拘捕她！","id":101,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_npc_2269_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":102},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"驳回。","id":103,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/35/Avg_avg_npc_2267_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2269_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":104},{"type":"dialogue","name":"南多","text":"我——","id":105,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_npc_2269_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":106},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"别太依赖直觉，南多。","id":107,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/de/Avg_avg_npc_2267_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2269_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":108},{"type":"dialogue","name":"南多","text":"我知道您想让我找证据……","id":109,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_npc_2269_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":110},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"从你开始怀疑的那刻起，哪怕没有证据，也要先去发掘规律。","id":111,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_2267_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2269_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":112},{"type":"dialogue","name":"南多","text":"规律？","id":113,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2c/Avg_avg_npc_2269_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":114},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"没错。比如一个月前，打捞中心建成之后，城中发生了十多起前天那样的破坏事件。","id":115,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_2267_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"它们之间似乎毫无关联，但要是你在岗哨值班的时候，用打捞中心技术工的签到日志画画解闷，就会发现一些意想不到的线索。","id":116,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_2267_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2269_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"南多","text":"画……画画？","id":118,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_2269_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":119},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"这不是重点。重点是虽然我们前天遇到的那个技术工与破坏事件无关，但有几个特定的技术工……","id":120,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fe/Avg_avg_npc_2267_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":121},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"他们进行水下作业的日期与破坏事件发生的日期是完全重合的。","id":122,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_2267_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"或许这也能解释为什么近来深海教徒犯案次数逐渐减少，他们不是没有帮手，只是帮手的身份变了。","id":123,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_2267_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2269_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":124},{"type":"dialogue","name":"南多","text":"您怀疑这些破坏事件与打捞中心的岛民有关？那……","id":125,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_2269_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":126},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"我们只是巡逻组的成员。目前我们没有实证也没有搜查权，不要给自己惹麻烦。","id":127,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_2267_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2269_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":128},{"type":"dialogue","name":"南多","text":"（紧盯特菲）","id":129,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_npc_2269_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2267_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":130},{"type":"dialogue","name":"德鲁莎","text":"唉，什么都没听进去，比驮兽还倔。至少等我走了再动手吧，别给我添麻烦。","id":131,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_npc_2267_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":132},{"type":"dialog","id":133},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":134},{"type":"charslot","id":135},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":136},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_bg_74_g10_underseacorr.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":137},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":138},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":139},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act28side/m_avg_wasteland_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":140,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":141},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":142},{"type":"dialogue","name":"干练的技术工","text":"站住，纳乔！怎么又来观测厅？我可检查过了，今天没有你的排班。","id":143,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":144},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":145},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":146},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"阿奎拉……","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/35/Avg_avg_4232_hbound_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"我说过多少遍了，哪怕你一天不吃不喝全泡在水下连接供能端口，甚至因公殉职，伊比利亚人也不会感激你。","id":150,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"我担任水下作业组的技术负责人不是为了让他们感激我。","id":152,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/35/Avg_avg_4232_hbound_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":153},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"“我是不想让他们对岛民的误解再加深”……行了行了，你刚刚是不是又下水了？","id":154,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"嗯……嘶。","id":156,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5f/Avg_avg_4232_hbound_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":157},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"手臂上的锈斑已经蔓延到肩上的神经接口，还有——","id":158,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":159},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"关节处的螺栓怎么丢了？那是鲁菲纳奶奶留给你的过去的老型号，根本找不到替换件！","id":160,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/90/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":161},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"前天不是才帮你拿了防水涂料和生物阻隔剂吗？不对，前天……","id":162,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":163},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"前天结束任务后你直接去参加岛民互助会了，阿奎拉。","id":164,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/35/Avg_avg_4232_hbound_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":165},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"抱歉。下次跟我一起去吧，还能提醒我一下。","id":166,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"那儿的氛围我不太适应。","id":168,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_4232_hbound_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":169},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"怎么，打破你对伊比利亚的美好向往了？","id":170,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":171},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"阿奎拉，这里已经足够好了。","id":172,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/35/Avg_avg_4232_hbound_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"还不够。能自由地选择工作，能不用每天被惩戒军盘问，这些在伊比利亚人眼中是日常，但对我们而言却是一种殊荣？荒谬！","id":174,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/90/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"而且你知道，鲁菲纳奶奶想要的也绝不只是这样。","id":176,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"……","id":178,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_4232_hbound_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"至少他们安排了一名阿戈尔人来担任打捞中心的新监事。","id":179,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_4232_hbound_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"无济于事。一个阿戈尔的前执政官不能也不会对伊比利亚的同胞上心。","id":181,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":182},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"你不打算参加她的欢迎会吗？","id":183,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/35/Avg_avg_4232_hbound_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"我宁愿去互助会，与我真正的同胞在一起。","id":185,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":186},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":187},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"200,0","duration":"1","afrom":"1","ato":"0","id":188},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":189},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":190},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"……","id":191,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/04/Avg_avg_4232_hbound_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":192},{"type":"dialog","id":193},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":194},{"type":"charslot","id":195},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":196},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/86/Avg_bg_49_g12_diving.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":197},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_deepsearapid","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","id":198},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":199},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":200},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_swimdeepsea","id":201},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2278_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":202},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":203},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_calm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":204,"musicid":2},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"清晰的女声","text":"海洋。","id":206},{"type":"dialogue","name":"清晰的女声","text":"混合层不算太深，这里的海水总是温暖、明亮。微小的浮游生物像空气中的灰尘，恣意游动。","id":207},{"type":"dialog","id":208},{"type":"dialog","id":209},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"verticalslider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":210},{"type":"charslot","id":211},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_bg_51_g12_seabed.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":212},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"verticalslider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":213},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":214},{"type":"dialogue","name":"清晰的女声","text":"海床。","id":215},{"type":"dialogue","name":"清晰的女声","text":"大海的土壤，也是雷亚-伊比利亚沉睡的地方。","id":216},{"type":"dialogue","name":"清晰的女声","text":"它也连接着大陆架上的每一座岛屿，如果你有兴趣，可以漫步海底，走过每一座失落的城镇。","id":217},{"type":"dialog","id":218},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","action":"jump","posto":"200,0","power":"-50","times":"1","duration":"1.5","name":"avg_npc_2278_1#1$1","id":219},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":220},{"type":"dialogue","name":"紧张的潜水员","text":"呼——呼——","id":221,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f3/Avg_avg_npc_2278_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":222},{"type":"dialogue","name":"清晰的女声","text":"放轻松，莫雷诺。这身潜水服相当于让你拥有了鳞兽的鳔，别害怕水流，借它们的力浮起来。","id":223},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"l","id":224},{"type":"dialogue","name":"紧张的潜水员","text":"我、我明白了，克莱门莎监事。原本我只是想来参加您的欢迎会，现在却在伊比利亚南部海岸的水下漫步……","id":225,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f3/Avg_avg_npc_2278_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":226},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"就当是我独特的欢迎方式吧。","id":227},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"阿戈尔与伊比利亚都是依海而生的国度。“岛屿”“波浪”“海床”……我们有许多共通的、关于大海的词语。","id":228},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"这片流动的蓝色环带本身并不可怕。或许有一天，你们不用再借助阿戈尔的全息影像，而是能在真正的、没有界限的海底漫步。","id":229},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"l","id":230},{"type":"dialogue","name":"紧张的潜水员","text":"难以置信，我能感受到脸上模糊的阳光，脚下粗糙的贝壳碎屑，还有海流在推动我的后背……","id":231,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f3/Avg_avg_npc_2278_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":232},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"啊，不好意思，推你的是负责投影的小帮手。它似乎想提醒你，想要体验的技术工还有很多。","id":233},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"l","id":234},{"type":"dialogue","name":"紧张的潜水员","text":"抱、抱歉。","id":235,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f3/Avg_avg_npc_2278_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":236},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":237},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":238},{"type":"charslot","id":239},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_switchdata","id":240},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b2/Avg_bg_51_g4_aegirstreet_1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":241},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":242},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":243},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2278_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":244},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":245},{"type":"dialogue","name":"紧张的潜水员","text":"这是哪里？奇妙的建筑，还有很多穿白袍的阿戈尔人……他们是在空中游动？","id":246,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f3/Avg_avg_npc_2278_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":247},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"抱歉，环境模拟出了一点差错。小帮手，重新校准数据。","id":248},{"type":"dialog","id":249},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_simulationsystem_off","id":250},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":251},{"type":"charslot","id":252},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":253},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/08/Avg_bg_74_g11_clmsoffice.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":254},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":255},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":256},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2273_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":257},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":258},{"type":"dialogue","name":"紧张的潜水员","text":"克莱门莎监事，刚刚我看到的就是阿戈尔？","id":259,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_2273_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1","id":260},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"是阿戈尔的海底城市，弥利亚留姆，也是我曾经执政、生活的地方，我的家。","id":261,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"离开它之前，我请了两天假，一天用来温习伊比利亚语，检修体内的语言模块，一天用来记住这座城市。","id":262,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"你看到的，是根据我的记忆复现的场景。","id":263,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2273_1#1$1","id":264},{"type":"dialogue","name":"紧张的潜水员","text":"我甚至都不知道该不该叫它城市，它和我待过的所有地方都太不一样了……阿戈尔和我们，到底还是离得太远……","id":265,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_2273_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"紧张的潜水员","text":"克莱门莎监事，您可以告诉我，在阿戈尔语中“阿戈尔人”是怎么说的吗？我、我想——","id":266,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_2273_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1","id":267},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"你是想知道，除了“岛民”之外，你是否还拥有另一个称呼，对吗？","id":268,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2273_1#1$1","id":269},{"type":"dialogue","name":"紧张的潜水员","text":"您怎么知道……","id":270,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_2273_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#11$1","id":271},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"（阿戈尔语）阿戈尔人。","id":272,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/46/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1","id":273},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"请记好，你与我在阿戈尔的语汇中，都以“阿戈尔人”指称。","id":274,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2273_1#1$1","id":275},{"type":"dialogue","name":"紧张的潜水员","text":"阿……戈……","id":276,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_2273_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"紧张的潜水员","text":"（发音生涩的阿戈尔语）“阿戈尔人”……","id":277,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_2273_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":278},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_errormessage","id":279},{"type":"dialogue","name":"语言模块","text":"检测到无法识别的词语，请使用者再次向说话者确认。","id":280},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#3$1","id":281},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"……","id":282,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8b/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":283},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":284},{"type":"charslot","id":285},{"type":"background","id":286},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f4/Avg_74_i03_2.png","xScale":"1.2","yScale":"1.2","screenadapt":"coverall","x":"60","y":"-30","id":287},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":288},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":289},{"type":"text","text":"克莱门莎知道她对面的同胞听不到语言模块的语音提示，也只有她自己能看到浮在空中的警告弹窗。","id":290},{"type":"text","text":"他们的祖辈离开海洋来到伊比利亚生活，或许从他们的父辈开始，阿戈尔语就已经消失在记忆之中。","id":291},{"type":"text","text":"克莱门莎的亲切帮助他们打开了脑海深处未曾触碰的部分。","id":292},{"type":"dialog","id":293},{"type":"text","text":"“大海”“游动”“阿戈尔”“阿戈尔人”……","id":294},{"type":"dialog","id":295},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_errormessage","id":296},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.1","r":"1","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":297},{"type":"cgitem","image":"cgitem_74_i03_3","style":"cg","layer":"1","pfrom":"-160,-30","pto":"-160,-30","afrom":"0","ato":"1","aduration":"0.5","sfrom":"1","sto":"1.1","sduration":"0","id":298},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"1","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":299},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_errormessage","id":300},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.1","r":"1","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":301},{"type":"cgitem","image":"cgitem_74_i03_2","style":"cg","layer":"1","pfrom":"-430,50","pto":"-430,50","afrom":"0","ato":"1","aduration":"0.5","sfrom":"0.9","sto":"1","sduration":"0","id":302},{"type":"cgitem","image":"cgitem_74_i03_1","style":"cg","layer":"1","pfrom":"-240,-20","pto":"-240,-20","afrom":"0","ato":"1","aduration":"0.5","sfrom":"1","sto":"1.1","sduration":"0","id":303},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"1","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":304},{"type":"cgitem","image":"cgitem_74_i03_2","style":"cg","layer":"1","sfrom":"1","sto":"0.9","sduration":"40","pfrom":"-430,50","pto":"-420,50","pduration":"40","id":305},{"type":"cgitem","image":"cgitem_74_i03_3","style":"cg","layer":"1","sfrom":"1.1","sto":"1","sduration":"40","pfrom":"-160,-30","pto":"-165,-35","pduration":"40","id":306},{"type":"cgitem","image":"cgitem_74_i03_1","style":"cg","layer":"1","sfrom":"1.1","sto":"1","sduration":"40","pfrom":"-240,-20","pto":"-250,-10","pduration":"40","id":307},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","yTo":"0","xTo":"0","duration":"40","id":308},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":309},{"type":"text","text":"他们生涩的阿戈尔语，令克莱门莎的语言模块频频报错，弹窗几乎遮住了克莱门莎看向同胞们的视线。","id":310},{"type":"text","text":"上岸之前她已经做好了准备。她知道身为打捞计划的提出者，阿戈尔的代表，她无法插手伊比利亚的政策。","id":311},{"type":"text","text":"可她还是想接触这群在岸上生活的同胞，想为他们做些什么。","id":312},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":313},{"type":"text","text":"至少现在，她不想打断这群离家太久太久的同胞，他们有权重新拾回家乡的语言。但显然，并非所有同胞都能领受克莱门莎的好意。","id":314},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$darkness01_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_darkness01_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":315,"musicid":3},{"type":"dialogue","name":"警惕的岛民","text":"好了，都别再问了！","id":316},{"type":"dialogue","name":"警惕的岛民","text":"阿戈尔语离我们太远，学它有什么用？在审判庭盘问我们的时候，为自己加一条可疑的罪状吗？","id":317},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"先生，不要责怪你的朋友。若你不满意，可以直接指责我。","id":318},{"type":"dialogue","name":"警惕的岛民","text":"克莱门莎监事，我明白您没有恶意。","id":319},{"type":"dialogue","name":"警惕的岛民","text":"可在伊比利亚，尤其是对岛民而言，亲近海洋是危险的。我们面临的威胁不是靠浪漫的、诗意的词汇就能消除的。","id":320},{"type":"dialogue","name":"警惕的岛民","text":"如果我们需要，我们会向同样经历过伊比利亚摧残的同胞求助。至少在互助会里，我不会对自己的身份感到怀疑。","id":321},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"互助会……","id":322},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"（阿戈尔语）“阿戈尔人”。","id":323},{"type":"dialog","id":324},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_correctessage","id":325},{"type":"hidecgitem","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":326},{"type":"dialogue","name":"语言模块","text":"识别到词语，已校准模块，清除报错提示。","id":327},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"嗯？","id":328},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"如果一句标准的阿戈尔语就会让人罪加一等，那我早该待在地牢里了。","id":329},{"type":"dialog","id":330},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":331},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":332},{"type":"charslot","id":333},{"type":"image","id":334},{"type":"hidecgitem","id":335},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":336},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/08/Avg_bg_74_g11_clmsoffice.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":337},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":338},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":339},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2272_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":340},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":341},{"type":"dialogue","name":"警惕的岛民","text":"纳乔？","id":342,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_2272_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":343},{"type":"charslot","id":344},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1","duration":"0.8","id":345},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":346},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"阿戈尔语和伊比利亚语虽然发音很不一样，但只要找到方法，学会一个词也不是太难。","id":347,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/35/Avg_avg_4232_hbound_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"无论是“岛民”还是“阿戈尔人”，都是称呼我们的方法。多了解一种，就能多了解“我们”一点，不是吗？","id":348,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/35/Avg_avg_4232_hbound_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"盖乌斯，下午的水下作业我替你去吧？安赫拉昨天就在催你回家了。","id":349,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/35/Avg_avg_4232_hbound_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2272_1#1$1","id":350},{"type":"dialogue","name":"警惕的岛民","text":"……她身体不好，我回去看看她。","id":351,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_2272_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":352},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":353},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":354},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_glassdoorclose","id":355},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":356},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1","id":357},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"抱歉，克莱门莎监事。","id":358,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/35/Avg_avg_4232_hbound_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"他们只是最近负担太重，等真的用上阿戈尔制造的装备，水下作业的压力减轻了，他们就不会这样咄咄逼人了。","id":359,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/35/Avg_avg_4232_hbound_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1","id":360},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"减轻他们的负担是我的工作，审判他们可不是。无需多虑。还有，谢谢你替我解围，纳乔。","id":361,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1","id":362},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"您太客气了。","id":363,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/35/Avg_avg_4232_hbound_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1","id":364},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"你是水下作业组的对吗？我听说在审判庭最初接管打捞中心的时候，他们欠缺经验，你帮了他们很多。","id":365,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"有时间的话向我介绍一下你的朋友们吧，我了解阿戈尔的技术，也想了解使用技术的人。","id":366,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_4231_clemnt_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#2$1","id":367},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"十分乐意。","id":368,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2e/Avg_avg_4232_hbound_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":369},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":370},{"type":"charslot","id":371},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":372},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b2/Avg_bg_74_g14_ibchurch_2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":373},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":374},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":375},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#4$1","duration":"1","id":376},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_2273_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":377},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":378},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":379},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"索莱达，你来了。上周你说迁居到城区之后，和伊比利亚人有不少摩擦，现在情况好转了吗？","id":380,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"r","id":381},{"type":"dialogue","name":"欣慰的岛民","text":"好了不少。我听从了导师和各位同胞的建议，保留了邻居蓄意伤害我的证据。","id":382,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_2273_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"欣慰的岛民","text":"之后，我找岗哨的审判官和惩戒军倾诉，说邻居的行为已经影响到了我打捞工作的进度。","id":383,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_2273_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"欣慰的岛民","text":"我不知道他们有没有做什么，但那几个邻居确实稍微安分了几天。","id":384,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_2273_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":385},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"只是权宜之策。如果你需要帮助，哪怕是宵禁之后，只要点亮我们的信号，就一定会有同胞帮你。","id":386,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"r","id":387},{"type":"dialogue","name":"欣慰的岛民","text":"不……我的意思是，我很感谢，但不想再麻烦你们了。","id":388,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_2273_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":389},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"你还是担心我们会把事情闹大，是吗？","id":390,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"r","id":391},{"type":"dialogue","name":"欣慰的岛民","text":"导师告诉过我，这个城区和我家乡以前的情况不一样，审判庭待我们会更公正，伊比利亚人也不会随意伤害我们。","id":392,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_2273_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"欣慰的岛民","text":"所以我才来这里的。这里确实比其他地方好些，这就够了。","id":393,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_2273_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":394},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"我不想伤你的心，但你有没有想过，如果你不会操作阿戈尔的技术设备，如果你只是负责后勤的普通工人，审判庭还会帮你吗？","id":395,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"r","id":396},{"type":"dialogue","name":"欣慰的岛民","text":"我……","id":397,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_2273_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":398},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"打捞计划公布之后，被召集的岛民大多是工程或航海领域的技术人才，他们重视的不是我们，而是他们自己的打捞计划。","id":399,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/90/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"港都中心城区打捞完成之后，我们又会去哪？是被遣散出境，还是回到令人厌恶的家乡？没有一个伊比利亚人会记得我们的付出。","id":400,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/90/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"r","id":401},{"type":"dialogue","name":"欣慰的岛民","text":"不会的……","id":402,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_2273_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":403},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"不会？你也不是没听到，那些伊比利亚人骄傲地谈起他们从父辈口中听来的，有关港都的传说时，有半个字提起过岛民吗？","id":404,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/90/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"他们甚至不知道，港都曾经的设计和建造，是由岛民主导的。","id":405,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/90/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","focus":"r","id":406},{"type":"dialogue","name":"欣慰的岛民","text":"……要是导师今天在这里，他不会认同你的观点。","id":407,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_2273_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_2271_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":408},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿奎拉","text":"没有他的认同，我们也应该为自己做些什么，哪怕只是“被记住”。","id":409,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a5/Avg_avg_npc_2271_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":410},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":411},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":412},{"type":"bgeffect","id":413},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":414},{"type":"hidecgitem","id":415},{"type":"image","id":416},{"type":"charslot","text":"","id":417}],"characters":["工头","阴沉的路人","洒脱的路人","萨尔瓦多","特菲","瓦列里奥","南多","德鲁莎","干练的技术工","纳乔","阿奎拉","清晰的女声","紧张的潜水员","克莱门莎","语言模块","警惕的岛民","？？？","欣慰的岛民"]}